n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>Jer's Junkyard is a junkyard located northeast of <a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a>. It consists of two small buildings, a sell zone, and mounds of junk. The area is encircled by a chain link fence.\n</p><p>You can speak to Jer Junkman to sell all of your resources within the sell zone. You can speak to Jerry Junkman to buy items from the building with the \"Jerry's Junk\" sign in the junkyard.\n</p><p><b>Selling metallic resources</b> to Jer's Junkyard will sell for <b>10%</b> <b>more</b> money than if you were to sell the ores to other sell points such as at The Oak Depot.\n</p><p><b>Selling wooden</b> <b>resources</b> to Jer's Junkyard will sell for <b>10% less</b> money than if you were to sell the wood to other sell points. \n</p><p>Jer's Junkyard has since been replaced by the Resource Hub, which pays full price for all resources. \n</p><p>In the new map, you can see Jer's Junkyard being way more destroyed. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inventory\">Inventory</span></h2>\n<p>This table will show all items available at Jerry's Junk.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Items\">Items</span></h3>\n<table class=\"fandom-table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th>Picture\n</th>\n<th>Price\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Grabby_Grabber\" title=\"Grabby Grabber\">Grabby Grabber</a>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/83/Grabby-Grabber-BOXED.png/revision/latest?cb=20230122120900\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Grabby-Grabber-BOXED\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/83/Grabby-Grabber-BOXED.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20230122120900\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"127\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Grabby-Grabber-BOXED.png\